-*   **$w$**: Weight for Empty/Opacity losses. Typical value: 1.0 [S5, unofficial].
-*   **$\lambda_{\text{gp}}$**: Multiplier for gradient penalty. Not given in the sources.
-*   **$\beta$ (Curriculum)**: Exponential decay rate. Value: $-10^5$ [S9].
